  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Viant’s AI-powered programmatic platform is gaining momentum as connected TV (CTV) becomes the majority share of ad spend, fueled by the structural shift to digital video. The acquisition of TVision Insights strengthens attention-measurement capabilities, deepening its CTV differentiation. While the narrative flags watchpoints around privacy regulations, automation-driven commoditization, and potential ad-budget pivots, demand remains robust—evidenced by record quarterly revenue and profitability that signal a healthy ad environment.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership consistently beats guidance, delivering record results and expanding margins. The TVision acquisition and ongoing AI enhancements illustrate proactive moves to entrench CTV leadership. Analyst upgrades and target increases reflect growing confidence in the team’s execution. Transparent communication and a track record of operational discipline reinforce credibility, positioning Viant to capture digital-advertising tailwinds while navigating emerging headwinds.",
